<title>FRANCE: Moulinex 9-mth sales fell 0.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Moulinex 9-mth sales fell 0.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover				     5,901  down 0.9 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Moulinex gave its sales figure in a statement. It said in on a like-for-like basis, sales fell 0.7 percent.</p>
<p>The mediocre performance was due to a disappointing third quarter in Europe. Turnover for the three months of October, November and December totalled 2,549 million francs, down 5.1 percent from the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
